*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_MPlane_resiliency_BFD_alarm_verification
    [Documentation]
    ...  The purpose of this test case is verification of proper functioning of newly introduced alarms.
    ...  CB005833 adds two new alarms that inform the user of failure of BFD session: "BFD down ingress"
    ...  and "BFD down egress".
    ...  Test prerequisites:
    ...    1) optical switch
    ...    2) list of module numbers connected to the port in Optical Switch must be assigned to
    ...       module_numbers parameter (with proper order 1st module - 1st link)
    ...    3) correct channel to enable link assigned to on_output_channels - order is important
    ...    4) correct channel to disable link assigned to off_output_channel - order is important
    ...  If testline requires specific (different than default) alarms lists to be checked or different ip address
    ...  to be used, please provide it in link_alarms_names, link_alarms_ids, ru_link_alarms_names, ru_link_alarms_ids
    ...  and ips arguments.
    ...  For more information about TCs steps please navigate to: MPlane_resiliency_BFD_alarm_verification in QC.
    ...  Main test steps:
    ...    1) allowing alarms from link_alarms_names list
    ...    2) disconnecting Mplane Fronthaul link
    ...    3) waiting for alarms from link_alarms_names to be active on BTS
    ...    4) connecting disconnected Mplane Fronthaul link
    ...    5) waiting for alarms from link_alarms_names to be inactive on BTS
    ...    6) disallowing alarms from link_alarms_names list
    ...    7) repeating 1) - 6) steps for every module number in module_numbers
    ...    8) allowing alarms from ru_link_alarms_names list
    ...    9) blocking Fronthaul link on RMOD
    ...    10) waiting for alarms from ru_link_alarms_names to be active on BTS
    ...    11) unblocking Fronthaul link on RMOD
    ...    12) waiting for alarms from ru_link_alarms_names to be inactive on BTS
    ...    13) disallowing alarms from ru_link_alarms_names list
    ...    14) repeating 8) - 13) steps for every ip address in ips
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param list of int module_numbers: (Mandatory) :
    ...         List of module numbers on optical switch to be disconnected and connected.
    ...         Example: [3, 2]
    ...  :param int rmod_id: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Id of used RMOD.
    ...         Example: 1
    ...  :param list of str ips: (Optional) :
    ...         List of ip addresses which will be used to block fronthaul link on RMOD.
    ...         Default value: ['10.1.1.1', '10.1.2.1']
    ...  :param int/str rmod_block_port: (Optional) :
    ...         Port number to block fronthaul link on RMOD. If not provided, port number will be taken from RMOD table.
    ...         Default value: None
    ...  :param list of list link_alarms_names: (Optional) :
    ...         List of lists with alarms names which will be checked during disconnecting Mplane fronthaul link
    ...         via optical switch.
    ...         Default value: [['BFD-1 down in ingress', 'Receiving failure in Optical Interface'],
    ...                         ['BFD-2 down in ingress', 'Receiving failure in Optical Interface']]
    ...  :param list of list link_alarms_ids: (Optional) :
    ...         List of lists with alarms ids which will be checked during disconnecting Mplane fronthaul link
    ...         via optical switch.
    ...         Default value: [[61605, 2002], [61605, 2002]]
    ...  :param list of list ru_link_alarms_names: (Optional) :
    ...         List of lists with alarms names which will be checked during blocking fronthaul link on RMOD.
    ...         Default value: [['BFD-1 down in egress'], ['BFD-2 down in egress']]
    ...  :param list of list ru_link_alarms_ids: (Optional) :
    ...         List of lists with alarms ids which will be checked during blocking fronthaul link on RMOD.
    ...         Default value: [61606, 61606]
    ...  :param int off_output_channel: (Optional) :
    ...         Number of output channel to disable link on optical switch.
    ...         Default value: 4
    ...  :param list of int on_output_channels: (Optional) :
    ...         Number of output channels to enable link on optical switch for every module number.
    ...         Default value: [1, 1]
    ...  :param int optical_switch_id: (Optional) :
    ...         Id of used optical switch.
    ...         Default value: 0
    [Arguments]                                        ${module_numbers}
    ...                                                ${rmod_id}
    ...                                                ${ips}=${ips}
    ...                                                ${rmod_block_port}=${None}
    ...                                                ${link_alarms_names}=${link_alarms_names}
    ...                                                ${link_alarms_ids}=${link_alarms_ids}
    ...                                                ${ru_link_alarms_names}=${ru_link_alarms_names}
    ...                                                ${ru_link_alarms_ids}=${ru_link_alarms_ids}
    ...                                                ${off_output_channel}=4
    ...                                                ${on_output_channels}=${on_output_channels}
    ...                                                ${optical_switch_id}=0

    ${bts_type}=                                       hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    Create admin session with default alias            bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${connection}=                                     connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

    Alarms.Allow alarm                                 fault_id=4003
    ...                                                fault_name=Transmission path failure
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

    FOR    ${index}    ${module_number}    IN ENUMERATE    @{module_numbers}
        Allow Alarms Due To Disconnecting Mplane Fronthaul Link
        ...                                            fault_ids=${link_alarms_ids[${index}]}
        Disconnect Specific Mplane Fronthaul Link      module_number=${module_number}
        ...                                            optical_switch_id=${optical_switch_id}
        ...                                            off_output_channel=${off_output_channel}
        Robot Log Operation                            Waiting for alarms to be active...
        Alarms.Wait And Check For Active Alarms        list_of_fault_names=${link_alarms_names[${index}]}
        ...                                            timeout=600s
        Connect Specific Mplane Fronthaul Link         module_number=${module_number}
        ...                                            optical_switch_id=${optical_switch_id}
        ...                                            on_output_channel=${on_output_channels[${index}]}
        Robot Log Operation                            Waiting for alarms to be inactive...
        Alarms.Wait And Check For Inactive Alarms      list_of_fault_names=${link_alarms_names[${index}]}
        ...                                            list_of_fault_ids=${link_alarms_ids[${index}]}
        ...                                            timeout=600s
        Disallow And Check Alarms After Connecting Mplane Fronthaul Link
    END

    FOR    ${index}    ${ip}    IN ENUMERATE    @{ips}
        Alarms.Allow Alarms                            fault_ids=${ru_link_alarms_ids[${index}]}
        Block Specific Fronthaul Link On RMOD          rmod_id=${rmod_id}
        ...                                            connection=${connection}
        ...                                            link_number=${index}
        ...                                            ip=${ip}
        ...                                            rmod_block_port=${rmod_block_port}
        Robot Log Operation                            Waiting for ${ru_link_alarms_names[${index}]} alarm to be active...
        Alarms.Wait And Check For Active Alarms        list_of_fault_names=${ru_link_alarms_names[${index}]}
        ...                                            timeout=600s

        Unblock Specific Fronthaul Link On RMOD        rmod_id=${rmod_id}
        ...                                            connection=${connection}
        ...                                            link_number=${index}
        ...                                            ip=${ip}
        Robot Log Operation                            Waiting for ${ru_link_alarms_names[${index}]} alarm to be inactive...
        Alarms.Wait And Check For Inactive Alarms      list_of_fault_names=${ru_link_alarms_names[${index}]}
        ...                                            list_of_fault_ids=${ru_link_alarms_ids[${index}]}
        ...                                            timeout=600s
    END

    Alarms.Disallow alarm                              fault_id=4003
    ...                                                fault_name=Transmission path failure
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}
    [Teardown]                                         BFD Alarm Verification Teardown
    ...                                                module_numbers=${module_numbers}
    ...                                                optical_switch_id=${optical_switch_id}
    ...                                                on_output_channels=${on_output_channels}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}


BFD Alarm Verification Teardown
    [Arguments]                                        ${module_numbers}
    ...                                                ${optical_switch_id}
    ...                                                ${on_output_channels}
    ...                                                ${bts_type}
    Robot Log Operation                                BFD Alarm Verification Teardown...
    FOR    ${index}    ${module_number}    IN ENUMERATE    @{module_numbers}
        Connect Specific Mplane Fronthaul Link         module_number=${module_number}
        ...                                            optical_switch_id=${optical_switch_id}
        ...                                            on_output_channel=${on_output_channels[${index}]}
    END
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                              fault_id=4003
    ...                                                fault_name=Transmission path failure
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}


Allow Alarms Due To Disconnecting Mplane Fronthaul Link
    [Arguments]                                        ${fault_ids}
    Alarms.Allow Alarms                                fault_ids=${fault_ids}
    Alarms.Allow alarm                                 fault_name=Unit synchronization failed
    ...                                                fault_id=16
    Alarms.Allow alarm                                 fault_name=Unstable eCPRI Link Detected
    ...                                                fault_id=4741


Disallow And Check Alarms After Connecting Mplane Fronthaul Link
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                              fault_name=Unit synchronization failed
    ...                                                fault_id=16
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                              fault_name=Unstable eCPRI Link Detected
    ...                                                fault_id=4741
    Alarms.Check if alarm is inactive                  fault_name=Unit synchronization failed
    ...                                                fault_id=16
    Alarms.Check if alarm is inactive                  fault_name=Unstable eCPRI Link Detected
    ...                                                fault_id=4741


Disconnect Specific Mplane Fronthaul Link
    [Arguments]                                        ${module_number}
    ...                                                ${optical_switch_id}
    ...                                                ${off_output_channel}
    Robot Log Operation                                Disconnecting ${module_number} Fronthaul Link...
    Set Optical Switch Position                        optical_switch_id=${optical_switch_id}
    ...                                                module_number=${module_number}
    ...                                                output_channel=${off_output_channel}
    Robot Log Result                                   ${module_number} Fronthaul Link has been disconnected successfully.
    ...                                                to_console=${True}


Connect Specific Mplane Fronthaul Link
    [Arguments]                                        ${module_number}
    ...                                                ${optical_switch_id}
    ...                                                ${on_output_channel}
    Robot Log Operation                                Connecting ${module_number} Fronthaul Link...
    Set Optical Switch Position                        optical_switch_id=${optical_switch_id}
    ...                                                module_number=${module_number}
    ...                                                output_channel=${on_output_channel}
    Robot Log Result                                   ${module_number} Fronthaul Link has been connected successfully.
    ...                                                to_console=${True}


Block Specific Fronthaul Link On RMOD
    [Arguments]                                        ${rmod_id}
    ...                                                ${connection}
    ...                                                ${link_number}
    ...                                                ${ip}
    ...                                                ${rmod_block_port}
    ${link_number}               Evaluate              ${link_number}+1
    Robot Log Operation                                Blocking ${link_number} fronthaul link on RMOD-${rmod_id}...
    ${table_ip_filter}=                                rmod_operations.execute_ssh_command
    ...                                                rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                command=sudo su -c 'nft -n -a list chain filter INPUT'
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    Robot Log Result                                   ${table_ip_filter}
    ...                                                to_console=${True}

    ${port}=                                           Run Keyword If  '${rmod_block_port}'=='${None}'
    ...                                                utilities.get_port_number_to_block_from_rmod_table_ip_filter
    ...                                                table_ip_filter=${table_ip_filter}
    ...  ELSE
    ...                                                Set Variable
    ...                                                ${rmod_block_port}
    Robot Log Result                                   port number to block: ${port}
    ...                                                to_console=${True}

    ${output}=                                         rmod_operations.execute_ssh_command
    ...                                                rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                command=sudo su -c 'nft insert rule ip filter INPUT position ${port} ip saddr ${ip} udp sport 53784 drop'
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    Robot Log Result                                   ${output}
    ...                                                to_console=${True}


Unblock Specific Fronthaul Link On RMOD
    [Arguments]                                        ${rmod_id}
    ...                                                ${connection}
    ...                                                ${link_number}
    ...                                                ${ip}
    ${link_number}               Evaluate              ${link_number}+1
    Robot Log Operation                                Unblocking ${link_number} fronthaul link on RMOD-${rmod_id}...
    ${table_ip_filter}=                                rmod_operations.execute_ssh_command
    ...                                                rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                command=sudo su -c 'nft -n -a list chain filter INPUT'
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    Robot Log Result                                   ${table_ip_filter}
    ...                                                to_console=${True}
    ${ports}=                                          utilities.get_port_numbers_to_unblock_from_rmod_table_ip_filter
    ...                                                ip_address=${ip}
    ...                                                table_ip_filter=${table_ip_filter}
    Robot Log Result                                   ports list: ${ports}
    ...                                                to_console=${True}
    FOR    ${port}    IN    @{ports}
        ${unblocking_port}=                            rmod_operations.execute_ssh_command
        ...                                            rmod_id=${rmod_id}
        ...                                            command=sudo su -c 'nft delete rule filter INPUT handle ${port}'
        ...                                            connection=${connection}
        Robot Log Result                               ${unblocking_port}
        ...                                            to_console=${True}
    END
